The Constitution text is published by the Supreme Commission for Elections and Referendum of Yemen
(http://www.scer.org.ye/arabic/dstora.htm), read from Internet Archive captures. SCER publishes no terms.

Basis for reuse. Yemen's Law No. 15 of 2012 on Copyright and Related Rights excludes official documents, such
as the texts of laws, regulations, government decisions and judicial verdicts, from protection. The text is
published on that basis and will be withdrawn on request.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
